          "passageId": "english-pre-a1-m044-reading-passage-01",
          "passage": "Mia walks with her dad on the street. They come to a traffic light. The light is red. Dad says, “Stop.” They wait together. The light turns green. Dad looks both ways and says, “Now we can go. Stay with me.” Mia holds Dad's hand and they cross safely."
